sequenceDiagram
    participant PG as Executor
    participant F as valkey_fdw
    participant V as Valkey
    PG->>F: next tuple
    F->>V: SCAN cursor MATCH prefix COUNT n
    V-->>F: cursor + up to n keys
    F->>V: GET/HGETALL ×n  (pipelined, up to pipeline_batch)
    V-->>F: n replies
    loop per key
        F->>F: overlay check (this transaction's own writes)
        F-->>PG: tuple
    end
    Note over F,V: cursor 0 ends the traversal —<br/>on a cluster, only after every primary
